// @title Kick with a pitch envelope
// @category drums
// @details A kick shaped by its pitch envelope: pdec sets how fast the pitch falls, pcurve how it
//   bends. Longer pdec gives a deeper, booming kick.
// @tags kick, electro, techno
// @by alienmind
// @credits DJ_Dave
s("bd*4").bank("RolandTR909").pcurve(2).pdec("<.2 .5 1 .5>").gain(.9)
